    <item>
      <title>0.162.1</title>
      <link>https://github.com/openai/codex/releases/tag/rust-v0.162.1</link>
      <description>Bug Fixes
Fixed a TUI crash when asynchronous questions contain multiple lines, preserving line breaks and complete hyperlink destinations. (
#51866
)
Fixed startup failures caused by differences between a running background server's feature settings and CLI defaults. Compatibility checks now apply only to explicit command-line feature overrides. (
#52648
)
Full Changelog:
